an begin="2:54.079" end="2:54.759">我</span></p><p begin="2:54.934" end="2:57.896" itunes:key="L36" ttm:agent="v1000"><span begin="2:54.934" end="2:55.920">现在放开</span><span begin="2:55.920" end="2:56.816">双手</span><span begin="2:56.816" end="2:57.234">是</span><span begin="2:57.234" end="2:57.477">对</span><span begin="2:57.477" end="2:57.896">的</span></p><p begin="2:58.060" end="3:09.609" itunes:key="L37" ttm:agent="v1000"><span begin="2:58.060" end="2:58.547">别管</span><span begin="2:58.547" end="2:59.850">我</span><span begin="2:59.850" end="3:00.433">多</span> <span begin="3:00.620" end="3:01.491">舍不</span><span begin="3:01.491" end="3:09.609">得</span></p></div><div begin="3:10.428" end="3:38.803" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="3:10.428" end="3:17.105" itunes:key="L38" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="3:10.428" end="3:11.781">如果爱</span><span begin="3:11.781" end="3:12.611">忘</span><span begin="3:12.611" end="3:13.393">了</span> <span begin="3:13.822" end="3:15.140">就放他</span><span begin="3:15.140" end="3:16.040">走</span><span begin="3:16.040" end="3:17.105">吧</span></p><p begin="3:17.286" end="3:19.921" itunes:key="L39" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:17.286" end="3:18.635">那些幸</span><span begin="3:18.635" end="3:19.535">福</span><span begin="3:19.535" end="3:19.921">啊</span></p><p begin="3:19.931" end="3:23.829" itunes:key="L40" ttm:agent="v1000"><span begin="3:19.931" end="3:20.384">让</span><span begin="3:20.384" end="3:21.016">她</span><span begin="3:21.164" end="3:22.105">替我</span><span begin="3:22.105" end="3:22.923">到</span><span begin="3:22.923" end="3:23.829">达</span></p><p begin="3:23.839" end="3:30.914" itunes:key="L41" ttm:agent="v1000"><span begin="3:23.839" end="3:25.506">如果爱</span><span begin="3:25.506" end="3:26.375">懂</span><span begin="3:26.375" end="3:27.310">了</span> <span begin="3:27.655" end="3:28.925">承诺的</span><span begin="3:28.925" end="3:29.806">代</span><span begin="3:29.806" end="3:30.914">价</span></p><p begin="3:31.006" end="3:38.803" itunes:key="